examples-libnix: build/libnix/examples/test_startup build/libnix/examples/test_sw build/libnix/examples/test_gl build/libnix/examples/test_surface build/libnix/examples/test_thread build/libnix/examples/test_input build/libnix/examples/test_joystick build/libnix/examples/test_modes build/libnix/examples/test_fullscreen_sw build/libnix/examples/test_fullscreen_gl build/libnix/examples/test_filesystem build/libnix/examples/test_messagebox build/libnix/examples/test_dialog build/libnix/examples/test_time_locale build/libnix/examples/test_window_api build/libnix/examples/test_audio build/libnix/examples/test_sincos build/libnix/examples/test_math
examples: examples-clib2
examples-both: examples-clib2 examples-libnix


